Package: kali-ai-native-core
Version: 0.1.0
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-venv, python3-pip, sqlite3, systemd
Recommends: kali-ai-native-shell, kali-ai-native-agents
Maintainer: AI-native Kali project <maintainer@example.invalid>
Description: AI-native Kali - core runtime (Kanban, tools, observability)
 Installs the orchestration backbone of AI-native Kali: the Kanban core
 service, the guardrailed Kali tool frontend layer and the observability
 collector. Every unit of work on the system becomes a card on a board, and
 every tool invocation is written to a hash-chained audit log.
 .
 Phase 1 scope: services run locally on 127.0.0.1 and execute tools in
 dry-run mode by default.
